{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"536958989200af6fd6a554532cacfdc3a3fbbabaf1a83ed83826d3ae9f195817","ja":"……ふわぁ……。","zh":"……哈啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8c82c6a5d258b6eca55c5ee1aa5d7a82f59d61bf8d688d50c71b4ba2eecdd7a1","ja":"（……なんだか、すっごく眠たくなってきたヨ……。\nやっぱり、ちょっとくらい、寝ておけば……）","zh":"（……总觉得，变得好困好困啊……。\n果然还是，稍微睡一下比较好吗……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"97a38b438e7d0a7ad63b231b250a78d21ea5401c2e2c3ba09e5968a1c8e7d779","ja":"初夢っていえば……縁起が……ますよね？","zh":"说到初梦的话……就会……很吉利对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8ceee164146a34492e9a99c14bb887b24f648cb99c4138612435d75157b67d8f","ja":"ええ。富士……と、……と、あと……ですわね。\nそれで……。","zh":"是的。富士……还有、……还有、以及……对吧。\n然后……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ac5e64f07a0c8d5fd1170c57e241c2bb50696746fab54234b3cd2a2657bfd5fd","ja":"（……ふたりの声が……\n遠く……感じる……）","zh":"（……感觉两人的声音……\n越来越远了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a18725aaecc1e85fb5032172abf0eddcb283e0ab39b07ca7ef5173b21e56f9ae","ja":"すぅ……すぅ………………。","zh":"呼……呼………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8a124fec222847dfb9423165f71d2a002da7110649be69047f3b8f8607ed18d3","ja":"ハッ！　あれっ！？　ワタシ、寝てたノ……？","zh":"哈！咦！？我、睡着了……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3b9076cfdece2cbd3078492d9877f13c5cf35b539e9a101c3f2781c597cd095f","ja":"あっ、起きた？\n気持ちよさそうに寝てたけど、どんな夢を見てたの？","zh":"啊，你醒了？\n睡得那么香，做了什么梦呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f06f5dca6e9d6f33b84ef15c564dc7ca7d3da49179dc0e6d83b0b43b36fbe636","ja":"……ああっ！！　どうしよう、何も覚えてないヨ～！\nせっかくの初夢なのに～！！","zh":"……啊啊！！　怎么办，我什么都不记得了呀～！\n明明是难得的新年第一梦～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d2e6ef792d628abfde17082fa1ea7ec3fb917a003db572cf83c77da4145922e6","ja":"ふふ、そんなに慌てなくても、\nきっとそのうち思い出せますわ。","zh":"呵呵，不用那么着急，\n过一阵子肯定就能想起来的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ddfccc3e80bd432e7bc999da4f2d13e33c8d9a1188cc52a5c41a8f0efbf6dfec","ja":"それよりも、今はこの揚げたてアツアツの\nおナスを食べることに集中してくださいまし！","zh":"比起那个，现在请专心享用\n这刚炸好的热腾腾的茄子吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c8116f54f53a15515d5f2d3fa9af1508cad494262c09cbb4040697aca851d723","ja":"わぁっ、揚げナスが山になってる！？\nこんなにたくさん、食べきれないヨ～！","zh":"哇，炸茄子堆成山了！？\n这么多，根本吃不完啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"764afc4541f2a92a1ea28afe0963b2547c884f966ef094166d277579b43d5493","ja":"大丈夫！　ボクも一緒に食べるから！","zh":"没事的！我也会一起吃！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e9a2e83a844725a047a7e2b26e06212c0a712272f5fff72e28c279785a640063","ja":"……いや、むしろ世界中の揚げナスはボクのものだ！\n誰にも渡さないぞ～！　むっしゃむっしゃ……！","zh":"……不，倒不如说全世界的炸茄子都是属于我的！\n谁也不给～！嚼吧嚼吧……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"dab2d32dfccb14a1193f68ba21469b050ae44d54a29455f6611ef7952271cdfc","ja":"ええっ！？　あんなにあったのに、\nどんどんナスの山が小さくなってく……！","zh":"咦！？明明有那么多的，\n茄子堆却在不断变小……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"95c95897bd52f0c5f2a49d38b1743b4b31fa03b8116e760403e123ebdb93b92c","ja":"あら、いい食べっぷりですわね。\nでは、あと500本、追加ですわ♪","zh":"哎呀，吃得真香呢。\n那么，再加500串♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f9c26f0b4ce0040815a973a35f08cb2c24cad65f0ed107e3495880a19e8f6144","ja":"ドンッ！！！","zh":"咚！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"d3c43b823ef540638e548eef8c3515c6ec0ad0b1ebc643cddfa5d17086361c0c","ja":"やった～！　ボクといえばナス、ナスといえばボク！\n何本でも持ってきてくださいねっ！","zh":"太好了～！　说到我就是茄子，说到茄子就是我！\n不管拿来多少根都可以哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1518.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"3025e15476d7fa63ed5407101fd1fca417e61856817b0c9529f1b87fd7299d1e","ja":"マコトにそんなイメージあるなんて初耳だヨ！？\nも～、ふたりともどうしちゃったノ～！？","zh":"真竟然还有这种印象，我还是头一次听说呢！？\n真是的～，你们两个到底怎么啦～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
